From 71f1abfe1acf3206e34832934f0cebd3ccbf59de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:51:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] bugfix: reject invalid configured certificate trust before
 requests

Configured CA failures must not silently replace the selected trust roots. Propagate construction errors through route-aware, login, plugin, update, and local-provider clients while retaining their routing policies.
